{"seq":1,"slug":"failover-election","title":"故障切换与选主","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/availability/failover-election","wordCount":1449,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"故障切换与选主\">故障切换与选主</h1><p>凌晨三点，主库所在的机器内核 panic 了。从这一刻起，每一秒的写不可用都在烧钱。整个高可用体系最关键的考验就在这里：集群能不能在没有人值守的情况下，正确地、安全地选出一个新主库并把流量切过去？「正确」和「安全」这两个词背后藏着分布式系统里最阴险的几个 bug——误判、脑裂、数据回退。本节就是把这套救命机制拆开讲清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>故障切换（failover）指主库不可用时，把某个副本提升为新主库、恢复写服务的过程。它分手动和自动两种，自动故障切换是降低 <a href=\"../topologies/leader-follower\">主从复制</a> RTO 的关键，但也是引入脑裂风险的源头。整个流程由四步构成：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[健康检测&lt;br/&gt;主库心跳超时?] --&gt;|疑似宕机| B[确认故障&lt;br/&gt;多方投票避免误判]&#10;  B --&gt; C[选举新主&lt;br/&gt;选数据最新的副本]&#10;  C --&gt; D[共识授予&lt;br/&gt;多数派同意 + 抢占 leader key]&#10;  D --&gt; E[切换流量&lt;br/&gt;更新路由指向新主]&#10;  E --&gt; F[隔离老主&lt;br/&gt;fencing 防诈尸]&#10;  A --&gt;|心跳正常| A\">flowchart TD\n  A[健康检测&lt;br/&gt;主库心跳超时?] --&gt;|疑似宕机| B[确认故障&lt;br/&gt;多方投票避免误判]\n  B --&gt; C[选举新主&lt;br/&gt;选数据最新的副本]\n  C --&gt; D[共识授予&lt;br/&gt;多数派同意 + 抢占 leader key]\n  D --&gt; E[切换流量&lt;br/&gt;更新路由指向新主]\n  E --&gt; F[隔离老主&lt;br/&gt;fencing 防诈尸]\n  A --&gt;|心跳正常| A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>关键挑战</th>\n<th>出错后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>健康检测</td>\n<td>区分真死与网络抖动</td>\n<td>误判导致无谓切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选举新主</td>\n<td>选数据最新者</td>\n<td>选错则丢数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共识授予</td>\n<td>多数派同意</td>\n<td>少数派晋升引发脑裂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔离老主</td>\n<td>fencing 老主</td>\n<td>老主诈尸双写</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"健康检测-真死还是假死\">健康检测：真死还是假死</h2><p>判断主库是否宕机本质上是不可能完美的——网络分区让「主库挂了」和「我连不上主库」在远端看起来一模一样。检测靠心跳：协调者周期性探测主库，连续多次超时才判定故障。</p>\n<p>这里的张力是：超时阈值太短，一次网络抖动就触发不必要的切换（切换本身有成本和风险）；太长，则故障后迟迟不切，RTO 拉长。Raft 用随机化的选举超时（典型 150–300ms）来检测领导者缺失并避免多个候选者同时发起选举（来源：medium.com Distributed Consensus Raft 2026）。生产系统通常把数据库层面的检测窗口设在数秒，在误判率和 RTO 间取平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选主-为什么需要共识\">选主：为什么需要共识</h2><p>确认主库死了之后，必须选出唯一一个新主。这看似简单，却是分布式共识问题的核心——多个副本必须就「谁是新主」达成一致，且这个一致必须满足 <a href=\"../foundations/replication-consistency\">复制一致性模型</a> 里最强的线性一致：任何时刻最多有一个被公认的主库。</p>\n<p>实现这个保证的是共识算法。Raft 把节点分为 Leader、Follower、Candidate 三种角色，所有节点初始为 Follower，选举时 Candidate 自荐拉票，必须获得**多数派（&gt;50%）**选票才能当选——这个多数派要求正是防止脑裂的数学根基（来源：raft.github.io；devahmedali.click Leader Election 2026）。少数派一侧永远凑不齐多数票，因而无法选出主库，从根本上杜绝了「两个主库各自以为合法」。</p>\n<p>选哪个副本当新主也有讲究：应选复制进度最靠前（数据最新）的副本，否则晋升一个落后的副本等于主动丢弃那些它还没收到的事务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"防脑裂-fencing-与-leader-key\">防脑裂：fencing 与 leader key</h2><p>脑裂（split-brain）是故障切换最恐怖的失败：老主库其实没真死（只是网络分区），新主库被选出后，老主库网络恢复、仍以为自己是主、继续接受写入——于是两个主库并行收数据，事后无法合并，数据彻底分叉。</p>\n<p>防脑裂有两道锁。第一道是<strong>多数派共识</strong>：上一节说的「必须多数票才能当主」，保证被分区到少数侧的老主库无法维持合法性。第二道是<strong>fencing（隔离）</strong>：在新主接管前，用 STONITH（强制关停老主机器）、撤销老主的存储/网络访问、或基于 epoch/term 编号让旧主的写被拒绝。</p>\n<p>在 PostgreSQL 生态，Patroni 把这两道锁落地：节点必须在分布式存储（etcd/Consul/ZooKeeper）里抢到「leader key」才能晋升为主，且无法续约 leader key 的节点会被 Patroni 主动降级为副本；Patroni 要求多数派节点同意集群状态，阻止被隔离的节点成为主库（来源：crunchydata.com Patroni &amp; etcd；docs.percona.com Patroni）。etcd 自身用 Raft 保证这个 leader key 的存取是线性一致的，是 Kubernetes 全部集群状态的存储后端（来源：oneuptime.com Consensus Protocols 2026）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rto-的构成与压缩\">RTO 的构成与压缩</h2><p>故障切换的总耗时就是集群的 RTO，它由几段相加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RTO</mtext><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>检测</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>选举</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>追平</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>路由切换</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RTO} \\approx t_{\\text{检测}} + t_{\\text{选举}} + t_{\\text{追平}} + t_{\\text{路由切换}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">检测</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">选举</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">追平</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">路由切换</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>检测</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{检测}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">检测</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由心跳超时决定，是误判率与速度的权衡。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>选举</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{选举}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">选举</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 共识本身很快（亚秒到数秒）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>追平</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{追平}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">追平</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 新主可能还需应用完已收到但未提交的日志。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>路由切换</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{路由切换}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">路由切换</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 让客户端连到新主，靠 VIP 漂移、代理（如 MySQL Router）或服务发现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>MySQL 的 InnoDB Cluster（Group Replication + Router）作为生产级方案，典型 RTO 约 30–60 秒、RPO=0（来源：jusdb.com MySQL Explained 2026）。把 RTO 进一步压低主要靠加快检测和优化路由切换，但检测过快又会抬高误判率——这是永恒的权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>故障切换分健康检测、选举新主、共识授予、隔离老主四步，其总耗时即集群 RTO。</li>\n<li>健康检测无法完美区分真死与网络抖动，超时阈值是误判率与 RTO 的权衡。</li>\n<li>选主必须靠共识达成线性一致的「唯一主」，Raft 的多数派投票是防脑裂的数学根基，且应选数据最新的副本。</li>\n<li>防脑裂靠两道锁：多数派共识 + fencing（STONITH/leader key/epoch）；Patroni+etcd 是 PostgreSQL 的主流落地。</li>\n<li>RTO 由检测、选举、追平、路由切换相加，压低 RTO 与降低误判率相互掣肘。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"故障切换与选主","id":"故障切换与选主"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"健康检测：真死还是假死","id":"健康检测-真死还是假死"},{"level":2,"text":"选主：为什么需要共识","id":"选主-为什么需要共识"},{"level":2,"text":"防脑裂：fencing 与 leader key","id":"防脑裂-fencing-与-leader-key"},{"level":2,"text":"RTO 的构成与压缩","id":"rto-的构成与压缩"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"无主复制与法定人数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/topologies/leaderless-quorum"},"next":{"title":"读写分离与负载分担","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-replication-ha/availability/read-write-splitting"}}